{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22773","headline":"得微之到官後书备知通州之事怅然有感因成四章 四 · 白居易","name":"得微之到官後书备知通州之事怅然有感因成四章 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"通州海内恓惶地，司马人间冗长官。\n伤鸟有弦惊不定，卧龙无水动应难。\n劒埋狱底谁深掘，松偃霜中尽冷看。\n举目争能不惆怅，高车大马满长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}